{"4625240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "长安首富模拟器", "steam_appid": 4625240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625240/extras/主宣传图?t=1787132227\" /></span>This is an ancient Chinese open-world business simulation game where you start from nothing and gradually build your own commercial empire.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel freely between different towns, buy goods at low prices, sell them for profit, and accumulate wealth through trade. As your fortune grows, you can purchase land, invest in mining industries, and build stable businesses with long-term income. You can also open a private bank to manage loans and financial services, or pursue an official career to gain more resources and opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also features rich life progression systems, including building your own residence, meeting various characters, and managing family life. Trade, industrial investment, financial management, and career progression are all interconnected, allowing you to freely shape your own path from an ordinary citizen to a legendary figure of wealth and influence.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625240/extras/主宣传图?t=1787132227\" /></span>This is an ancient Chinese open-world business simulation game where you start from nothing and gradually build your own commercial empire.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel freely between different towns, buy goods at low prices, sell them for profit, and accumulate wealth through trade. As your fortune grows, you can purchase land, invest in mining industries, and build stable businesses with long-term income. You can also open a private bank to manage loans and financial s